A.HTTP SERVER

STEP 1: Atur IP Statik di kazdel
STEP 2: Install nginx

$ echo "nameserver 8.8.8.8" > /etc/resolv.conf
$ apk update
$ apk add nginx

STEP 3: Buat struktur directory

$ mkdir -p /root/myconfig
$ mkdir -p /root/myweb
$ mkdir -p /root/mylogs

Step 4: Buat file "indeks.html" di /root/myweb

<html>
<head>
<title>This is My Web</title>
</head>
<body>
<p>
This is my web
</p>
</body>
</html>

Step 5:Buat file "nginx.conf" di /root/myconfig

user root;
worker_processes auto;
worker_cpu_affinity auto;
pid /tmp/nginx.pid;
error_log /root/mylogs/error.log;
 
events { worker_connections 768; }
 
http {
    server {
        listen 80;
        server_name _;
 
        root /root/myweb;
        index index.html;
 
        location / {
            try_files $uri $uri/ =404;
        }
    }
}

Step 6:Buat file "start_http.sh" di /root/myconfig:
#!/bin/bash
 
nginx -c /root/myconfig/nginx.conf -g 'daemon off;'


Step 7: Berikan izin eksekusi buat file “start_http.sh”:

$ chmod +x start_http.sh

Step 8:Jalankan web server dengan perintah:
$ ./start_http.sh

B.DNS Server

STEP 1: setup ip statis Chenoborg
STEP 2:Buat struktur direktori:
$ mkdir -p /root/dns
$ mkdir -p /root/dnsdata

STEP 3: Install Bind
$ echo "nameserver 8.8.8.8" > /etc/resolv.conf
$ apk update
$ apk add bind

STEP 4:Buat file "named.conf" di /root/dns:


options {
    directory "/root/dns";
    listen-on { any; };
    allow-query { any; };
};

logging {
    channel default_log {
        file "/root/dns/named.log" versions 3 size 5m;
        severity info;
        print-time yes;
        print-severity yes;
        print-category yes;
    };

    category default { default_log; };
    category queries { default_log; };
};
 
zone "localhost" {
    type master;
    file "db.localhost";
};
 
zone "netics.my.id" {
    type master;
    file "db.netics.my.id";
};


STEP 5: Buat file "db.localhost":

$TTL 86400
@ IN SOA localhost. root.localhost. (
    1       ; serial
    3600    ; refresh
    1800    ; retry
    604800  ; expire
    86400 ) ; minimum
 
  IN NS localhost.
  IN A 127.0.0.1

STEP 6:Buat file "db.netics.my.id", memetakan "www.netics.my.id" ke IP web server (Kazdel):

$TTL 86400
@ IN SOA ns1.netics.my.id. admin.netics.my.id. (
    1       ; serial
    3600    ; refresh
    1800    ; retry
    604800  ; expire
    86400 ) ; minimum
 
  IN NS ns1.netics.my.id.
ns1 IN A [IP Prefix].200.12
www IN A [IP Prefix].200.11

STEP 7:Buat file "start_dns.sh" di /root/dns dan jalankan dns servernya:

#!/bin/sh
 
named -g -c /root/dns/named.conf

*Untuk melihat progress/aktivitas dari DNS Server, pantaulah di file /root/dns/named.log (gunakan tmux), dengan perintah:
$ tail -f /root/dns/named.log


Langkah Kerja, Integrasi dengan DHCP:
Agar seluruh client otomatis mengetahui alamat DNS server tanpa perlu diset manual satu per satu:


STEP 8:Edit file "dhcpd.conf" pada DHCP server yang sudah ada, tambahkan baris:

option dns [IP Prefix].200.12 8.8.8.8

STEP 9:Reload kembali DHCP server, lalu restart seluruh client agar setting DNS otomatis ter-set.

*Indikator Keberhasilan:
Di Sargon, cek /etc/resolv.conf:

$ cat /etc/resolv.conf

Lakukan ping dan curl memakai nama domain (bukan IP):

$ ping www.netics.my.id
$ curl -vL http://www.netics.my.id

Dari Ognisko, akses "http://www.netics.my.id" lewat Firefox



